  <Dominion_Setting_CouncilInterval>Days between Rim Council sessions: {0}</Dominion_Setting_CouncilInterval>
  <Dominion_Setting_CouncilMinTech>Lowest tech level with a council seat: {0}</Dominion_Setting_CouncilMinTech>
  <Dominion_Setting_CouncilMinTech_Desc>Factions below this tech level have no seat. By default tribals are excluded. A tribal vassal is represented by its overlord.</Dominion_Setting_CouncilMinTech_Desc>
  <Dominion_Setting_CouncilNoVeto>No faction has a veto. Votes are weighted by population, economy, military and allies. (In dev mode, the player can veto for testing.)</Dominion_Setting_CouncilNoVeto>

  <Dominion_Setting_HeadOfState>Your head of state is:</Dominion_Setting_HeadOfState>
