  <Dominion_DiplomatMode_ChosenAtDesk>Chosen at the Leadership Desk</Dominion_DiplomatMode_ChosenAtDesk>
  <Dominion_Setting_NoIdeologyFallback>Ideology is not active, so both are chosen at the Leadership Desk.</Dominion_Setting_NoIdeologyFallback>

  <Dominion_Setting_AllowIdeoReforms>Foreign influence can reform ideologies</Dominion_Setting_AllowIdeoReforms>
  <Dominion_Setting_AllowIdeoReforms_Desc>Influence mainly changes a faction's politics. With this on, very high foreign influence held for a long time can also change one minor precept of its ideology. Memes are never changed.</Dominion_Setting_AllowIdeoReforms_Desc>
  <Dominion_Setting_IdeoReformMinDays>Minimum days between reforms of one faction: {0}</Dominion_Setting_IdeoReformMinDays>

