  <Dominion_Setting_IntegrationsRestart>Changes take effect after restarting the game.</Dominion_Setting_IntegrationsRestart>

  <Dominion_Setting_Profiling>Profile Dominion's performance</Dominion_Setting_Profiling>
  <Dominion_Setting_Profiling_Desc>Measures how long each Dominion system takes. See the report in the dev menu under Dominion. Has a tiny cost while on.</Dominion_Setting_Profiling_Desc>

